 rm rm rm rm rm rm rm rm rm rm rm rm(SCM path,rm SCM mode)rm,
	 rm rm rm "Create a new directory named by @var{path}. rm If @var{mode} is omitted\n"
	 rm rm rm "then the permissions of the directory file are set using the current\n"
	 rm rm rm "umask. rm Otherwise they are set to the decimal value specified with\n"
	 rm rm rm "@var{mode}. rm The return value is unspecified.")
